      "content": "That makes sense. Could you also go into more detail about how pH levels influence the reaction? Specifically, I'm looking at how an alkaline environment vs an acidic environment affects the nucleophilic attack of the amino group on the carbonyl group. How does that change the overall rate of browning?",
